{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-53454-r4599181","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Ginger Snaps","sourcePageId":53454,"sourceRevision":"4599181","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-11-10T03:01:35Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Ginger%20Snaps&oldid=4599181","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:54:30.125Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cookies","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using allspice","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using clove","Category:Recipes using dark molasses","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using ground ginger","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"858054fa9f0a692027a41d4131272f47e37fd0314c7017ec0fc2640e76e0eea8","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cookie recipes\n| Yield = 500 cookies\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]]\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]], melted\n* 2 cups dark [[Cookbook:Molasses|molasses]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] dark [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* a little [[Cookbook:Allspice|allspice]]\n* 1 tsp ground [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] ground [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n* a little [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 10–12 cups [[Cookbook:All-purpose flour|all-purpose flour]]\n==Procedure==\n#Combine melted butter, molasses, sugar, and spices.\n#Add flour, mixing in 1 cup at a time up to 10 cups, working first with a fork, then by hand. Add another 1–2 cups flour just until the [[Cookbook:Dough|dough]] holds together.\n#Chill dough at least 2 hours in the refrigerator.\n#Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 350°F.\n#[[Cookbook:Dough#Rolling|Roll]] the dough out as thin as possible, and cut out shapes with [[Cookbook:Cookie Cutter|cookie cutters]].\n#Transfer cookie cutouts to a [[Cookbook:Baking Sheet|pan]] lined with [[Cookbook:Parchment Paper|parchment paper]].\n#[[Cookbook:Bake|Bake]] cookies in the preheated oven for 7 minutes. Let cool on a rack.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* For a spicier ginger flavor, increase the amount of ginger as desired.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark molasses]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with images]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes using allspice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clove]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground ginger]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Ginger Snaps","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 cups butter, melted","sourceText":"2 cups butter, melted","amountT